        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bibimbap means 'mixed rice' in Korean. The bowl arrives with rice at the bottom and neat mounds of seasoned vegetables on top. You add a spoonful of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gochujang",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gochujang"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sauce and mix everything together before eating. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each vegetable topping is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "namul ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "namul"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Preparing several different ones gives the dish its variety of colour, texture, and flavour."
          }
        ]
      },
